WEBVTT

00:34:22.978 --> 00:34:27.274
Excuse me. Do you mind?
Everywhere else is full.

00:34:32.779 --> 00:34:35.198
I'm Ron, by the way. Ron Weasley.

00:34:35.448 --> 00:34:38.076
I'm Harry. Harry Potter.

00:34:39.452 --> 00:34:41.496
So it's true!

00:34:41.705 --> 00:34:44.499
I mean, do you really have the...?

00:34:45.083 --> 00:34:47.961
- The what?
- The scar?

00:34:48.461 --> 00:34:50.505
Oh, yeah.

00:34:55.802 --> 00:35:00.974
- Anything off the trolley, dears?
- No, thanks. I'm all set.

00:35:05.020 --> 00:35:07.314
We'll take the lot.

00:35:18.033 --> 00:35:22.829
- Bertie bott's every flavor beans?
- They mean every flavor.

00:35:23.246 --> 00:35:26.625
There's chocolate
and peppermint and also...

00:35:26.833 --> 00:35:30.670
Spinach, liver and tripe.

00:35:30.879 --> 00:35:35.050
George sweared he got
a booger-flavored one once.

00:35:39.721 --> 00:35:45.060
- Are they real frogs?
- It's a spell. You want the cards.

00:35:45.268 --> 00:35:50.732
Each pack's got a famous witch
or wizard. I've got about 500 meself.

00:35:56.529 --> 00:36:00.325
That's rotten luck. They've only
got one good jump in them.

00:36:03.203 --> 00:36:07.082
- I've got Dumbledore!
- I got about six of him.

00:36:08.875 --> 00:36:10.418
Hey, he's gone!

00:36:10.585 --> 00:36:14.089
You can't expect him to
hang around all day, can you?

00:36:14.714 --> 00:36:17.842
This is scabbers. Pathetic, isn't he?

00:36:18.051 --> 00:36:19.219
A little.

00:36:19.427 --> 00:36:22.764
Fred gave me a spell
to turn him yellow. Want to see?

00:36:31.773 --> 00:36:33.400
Has anyone seen a toad?

00:36:33.775 --> 00:36:36.444
- A boy named Neville's lost one.
- No.

00:36:37.028 --> 00:36:41.366
Oh, are you doing magic?
Let's see, then.

00:36:42.409 --> 00:36:46.746
Sunshine, daisies, butter mellow

00:36:46.955 --> 00:36:50.083
turn this stupid, fat rat yellow

00:36:52.836 --> 00:36:58.466
are you sure that's a real spell?
Well, it's not very good, is it?

00:36:58.633 --> 00:37:01.928
I've only tried
a few simple ones myself...

00:37:02.137 --> 00:37:04.764
But they've all worked for me.

00:37:08.393 --> 00:37:10.437
For example:

00:37:10.812 --> 00:37:13.606
Oculus reparo.

00:37:15.650 --> 00:37:18.319
That's better, isn't it?

00:37:19.487 --> 00:37:23.408
Holy cricket, you're Harry Potter!

00:37:23.616 --> 00:37:27.162
I'm Hermione Granger.
And you are...?

00:37:27.912 --> 00:37:31.124
- I'm Ron Weasley.
- Pleasure.

00:37:31.332 --> 00:37:36.421
You two better change into robes.
I expect we'll be arriving soon.

00:37:40.508 --> 00:37:44.012
You've got dirt on your nose.
Did you know?

00:37:44.179 --> 00:37:46.181
Just there.

00:37:58.526 --> 00:38:02.322
Right, then.
First years, this way, please!
